Technical Report:
The 'USA Contiguous Lambert Conformal Conic' (ESRI:102004) is selected as t=
he most appropriate CRS for the task of reprojecting a county dataset withi=
n the United States. This CRS is specifically designed for the contiguous U=
nited States (CONUS) and is ideal for regional analysis, preserving area an=
d shape across large extents. The Lambert Conformal Conic projection is wel=
l-suited for mid-latitude countries like the USA, providing minimal distort=
